  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZS9rcCXvHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join-5865F2?logo=discord\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/superiormc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-Support-FF424D?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">)</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌍 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>全面革新世界生成：</strong></span></em> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">更多内容请查看截图标签</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1e82b6c-5e6c-4852-9c2a-d7709966851d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📜 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>庞大任务线：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>超过500个任务和100+个Boss</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b37ed76f-4904-4534-9b30-23cf6b5f5db3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛡️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>自定义职业系统：</strong></span> </em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">14个职业，拥有自定义经验值和技能界面</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0813bffb-8b9d-4b82-918a-1fc8230bfe34.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>🏹 </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>广阔技能树：</strong></span></em></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">超过250种完全自定义的能力</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd124415-1b9e-44b8-b910-ba34371db6d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🐍 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>30+种可召唤宠物：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">从蛇、灵魂秃鹫、雪豹，到老虎、獠牙猪和传送行者</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6975765-9cb9-4c7a-9d67-1408edd50cf0.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛒 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>庞大商店系统：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">数百种物品，减少单调和无效刷取</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6bb3ce0c-7f2a-4b90-a863-0c185f2ad99e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚔️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>全面装备改造：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">自定义系统模仿《流放之路》等ARPG游戏</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2faa721d-979d-47c4-ab4e-a8835e495e9f.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f85ca9fe-2bae-4042-92d7-a9c1d99b6e91.png\" alt=\"\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1635ed9-2c87-4979-989c-8fcc2f53b424.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20405704-e22d-46fc-b58d-8a894d73110c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"689\" height=\"500\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cc13d97a-9f71-40ca-914f-8fab7fcf291b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"765\" height=\"555\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌀 <em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">自定义技能图腾系统：</span></strong></em></span> 与技能树技能相辅相成，可实现数百种完全独特的混合构筑</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c8b2c8d9-3988-4df1-b09b-103d72b034c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">👹 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重新设计的Boss：</strong></span></em></span> 许多乏味的Boss（如监守者）已被彻底重做，拥有更具吸引力的机制</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8dbaf83a-9bcd-4b2c-aa6f-223a4ea0edd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"494\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_acd4774e-c8c6-4b20-9edc-7e60cdab7327.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"634\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☢️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>28种游戏机制修改：</strong></span></em></span> 施法者、隐形蜘蛛和核爆苦力怕</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f915cccd-8b50-4fbc-b72c-0deb50ecf058.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💎 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>自定义饰品、药水效果与武器：</strong></span></em> </span> 独特效果与隐藏特性</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_06b70fbf-5935-40d8-a8e9-fe33874dacdd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293866/description_99b5ff0c-43c8-4bb9-9270-9a59b99c36a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🧩 其他亮点：</span></h3><p>🪄 数十种独特机制，如<strong>施法宠物</strong>、战利品箱、背包升级、<strong>Boss变种</strong>（无限组合）、饰品栏扩展、<strong>数百种自定义配方</strong>、自定义矿石冶炼，以及更多更多</p><p>✅ 兼容<strong>远视视野（Distant Horizons）</strong><em>（不包含在内）</em></p><p>🤝 专为<strong>多人游戏</strong>打造</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">⚙️ 基于**数万行**手动编写的KubeJS脚本驱动</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">想和朋友们一起玩Superior吗？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我们推荐使用<em><strong>Wabbanode</strong></em>获取<strong>稳定</strong>且<strong>流畅</strong>的服务器托管服务 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252fpartner%252fsuperior\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293866/description_34d4c87d-8ab2-4c1f-9dff-2b5e9632c129.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p></p>",
